@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam lineThickness 1
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 160
hide empty members
title ScamQuest - Attempt State Machine Diagram
hide empty description
state Created
state InProgress {
}
InProgress : submitChoice [valid, more scenes] / save and advance
InProgress : resume / restore saved progress
state AwaitingFinalDecision {
}
AwaitingFinalDecision : resume / restore saved progress
state Completed
state Abandoned
[*] --> Created : createAttempt [published version]
Created --> InProgress : start / load initial scene
InProgress --> AwaitingFinalDecision : reachFinalDecision / save progress
AwaitingFinalDecision --> Completed : submitFinalDecision [valid choice and confidence 1..5]\n/ save decision and official score
Created --> Abandoned : abandon
InProgress --> Abandoned : abandon
AwaitingFinalDecision --> Abandoned : abandon
Completed --> [*]
Abandoned --> [*]
note right of InProgress
Rejected requests leave the state unchanged.
Disconnecting does not abandon an attempt.
end note
note right of Completed
Replay creates a separate ReplaySession.
It does not reopen or modify this attempt.
end note
@enduml
